# Only what `cargo build --release --bin sextant` needs goes into the build
# context: Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/ (sources + lexicon assets), model/
# (weights + calibration, compiled in via include_str!) and docs/openapi.yaml
# (served by the HTTP server).
